# The still for the README and the website: the main window, settled.
Output still.gif
Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1440
Set Height 810
Set Padding 12
Set Theme "Dracula"
Hide
Type "clear; HOME=/vhs/home TERM=xterm-256color ./concord-client" Enter
Sleep 5.5s
Space
Sleep 3s
Type@180ms "grapes-are-great"
Sleep 2.5s
Enter
Sleep 16s
Show
Sleep 500ms
Screenshot hero.png
